1
00:00:00,908 --> 00:00:03,788
(Howard:)Okay, talk soon.

2
00:00:04,704 --> 00:00:06,454
(Bernadette:)What's so great?

3
00:00:06,664 --> 00:00:10,334
(Howard:)It looks like I'm going into space
after all, heh.

4
00:00:11,127 --> 00:00:12,707
(Bernadette:)Howie, that's wonderful.

5
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:16,010
(Howard:)Uh-huh, wonderful.

6
00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:18,720
Yay!

7
00:00:22,513 --> 00:00:24,973
(Bernadette:)What happened?
I thought they cancelled your mission.

8
00:00:25,182 --> 00:00:29,062
They... They did.
But NASA really wants my telescope...

9
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:33,480
(Howard:)...up on the space station, so they're
putting me on an earlier launch.

10
00:00:33,691 --> 00:00:35,441
(Bernadette:)When?

11
00:00:35,651 --> 00:00:37,741
(Howard:)A week from Friday.

12
00:00:37,945 --> 00:00:40,535
(Bernadette:)What? We're getting married
that Sunday.

13
00:00:41,532 --> 00:00:46,742
You're right, heh. L... I can't go to space.
l have to get married...

14
00:00:46,954 --> 00:00:50,374
(Howard:)...and no one can say that's not
a good reason. I'll call him back.

15
00:00:51,959 --> 00:00:54,839
Wait. I don't wanna be the one
who stands in your way.

16
00:00:55,045 --> 00:00:58,505
(Howard:)Well, too bad, you already did.
It's a done deal. But I forgive you.

17
00:00:58,716 --> 00:01:01,026
No. That's not how I wanna start
our marriage.

